 an Indian deity.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-01-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2gum2eRvvWYRwKfIkqbNaznPdZP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2gum2eRvvWYRwKfIkqbNaznPdZP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/50712/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"919031","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Quel maggiordomo, in competizione","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Queen is on hand as the Butler wages culinary warfare against Prince Soma’s royal servant. The competition reaches an unprecedented level of ferocity when someone’s secret ingredient unleashes the demon god of curry.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-01-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8K34NpmlQ0kw0hg1Fe0cnYV1ero.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8K34NpmlQ0kw0hg1Fe0cnYV1ero.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/50712/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"919032","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Quel maggiordomo, castello solitario","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When the Young Master is defeated in a supernatural chess match, he must surrender his most prized possession to a ghostly prince. Locating a very old and very specific skull is the key to bringing Sebastian back.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-01-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5S6vgVaNYEN55fFQ5FLET9UWVlA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5S6vgVaNYEN55fFQ5FLET9UWVlA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/50712/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"919033","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Quel maggiordomo, il donatore","language":"it-IT"}